><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Picked up and observed additional 2 ton pick up weight. Pulled out slowly from 424 m to 20 m.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-07-01T04:15:01+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-07-01T04:30:01+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">20</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held tool box talk with crew regarding laying out overshot with fish.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-07-01T04:30:01+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-07-01T05:15:01+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Retrieved overshot with attached fish. Transferred complete assembly including fish from vertical to horizontal. Decided to backload overshot and fish to town for disassembly. 12-1/4&quot; FastTrack TRI mill was completely worn out.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-07-01T05:15:01+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-07-01T05:30:01+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held Tool Box Talk with crew prior to making up milling BHA.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-07-01T05:30:01+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-07-01T